  "description": "Vectors for the rules that every producer and consumer of the registry index must apply the same way. Each document is unsigned. A valid document must be accepted. An invalid document must be rejected for its reason, and its error must contain the text of names. A vector has either a document, or raw text when the problem cannot be written as a JSON value, such as a repeated key.",
